      "widgets_values": [
        "FIRST FRAME / PROMPTED CAMERA MOVE\n1. Load ONE already-textured, seamless 2:1 panorama. No playblast is used.\n2. Rewrite the scene description and one gentle camera move in ARTIST PROMPT. Start with a short dolly and level horizon.\n3. Set width=2xheight, FPS, and 8n+1 frames. Default: 1024x512, 65 frames, 24fps.\n4. Queue. MP4 and PNGs save under output/artist-handoff.\nCompanion panorama LoRA 0.20 is a 2.3-trained adapter tested here on 2.5. Motion and hidden geometry are inferred, not camera-path locked. Inspect poles and wrap in 360 before delivery."
      ],
      "title": "START HERE - artist instructions",
      "color": "#343",
      "bgcolor": "#353"
